{"unit_id":"HuaLQIn__dsh-annotation-jump#feature-1","repo":"HuaLQIn/dsh-annotation-jump","commit":"c50923e219ba6db0ad1f3b393cfe78cfc06be9bd","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@changfenhuang/dsh-annotation 的功能「回复文本批注」：选中助手回复中的文字后打开批注编辑器，可留下备注或只标记原文；保存后该条目加入当前会话的批注列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1874-1927","client.js:2060-2095"]}
